<!-- KWIZZ Radio Privacy Policy (PIPEDA, CASL, GDPR Compliant) -->
<div class="space-y-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto py-4">
  <div class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 pb-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full badge-gold text-xs font-semibold mb-2">
      <span>LEGAL &amp; COMPLIANCE</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white" style="color: var(--text-primary);">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1">
      Last Updated: October 30, 2026 &bull; Compliant with Canadian PIPEDA, CASL and GDPR
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-8 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Overview &amp; Our Commitment</h2>
      <p>
        KWIZZ Radio ("we", "us", or "our") operates the online radio website kwizzradio.ca based in Ottawa, Ontario, Canada. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting personal information in full compliance with the <em>Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act</em> (PIPEDA), Canada's Anti-Spam Legislation (CASL), and international data protection standards including the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. What Data We Collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-zinc-400">
        <li><strong>Song Requests:</strong> Requester name or handle, requested artist/song, optional dedication, and optional email address.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact Inquiries:</strong> Your name, email address, subject line, and message content.</li>
        <li><strong>Web Push Notifications:</strong> An encrypted browser push token (endpoint, p256dh, auth keys) only if you explicitly choose to subscribe. We never access your contacts or device identity.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical &amp; Anonymous Analytics:</strong> IP addresses (anonymized for rate-limiting and security abuse prevention), browser user-agent, pages viewed, and stream play/pause events. We do not use third-party cross-site behavioral tracking cookies.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">3. Cookies &amp; Local Storage</h2>
      <p>
        We use essential local storage to remember your chosen theme (dark vs. light mode), audio volume preferences, and cookie consent preferences. These are strictly functional and do not track you across other websites.
      </p>
      <p>
        Optional analytics cookies or telemetry may be enabled only with your consent via our Cookie Banner. You can change your choice at any time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">4. Canada's Anti-Spam Legislation (CASL)</h2>
      <p>
        We will only send marketing newsletters or event announcements if you have provided express consent via an opt-in checkbox on our forms. Every communication includes an easy one-click unsubscribe mechanism.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">5. Data Retention &amp; Your Right to Deletion</h2>
      <p>
        In accordance with PRD requirements, song request and contact form data are retained only as long as necessary for broadcast operations and customer service. You have the right to request deletion of your contact messages or request submissions at any time by contacting our Privacy Officer at <a href="mailto:privacy@kwizzradio.ca" class="text-amber-400 underline">privacy@kwizzradio.ca</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">6. Audio Streaming &amp; Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        Audio streaming is delivered via our licensed platform partner Live365. When connecting to the stream, your audio player directly requests the stream URL. No listening history is shared with unauthorized commercial data brokers.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

